  "data": {
    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Reaper’s Wager",
    "summary": "Your **DRUKHARI** units and your **HARLEQUINS** units are the 2 sides of a wager, and the **DRUKHARI** units start the battle winning it. The winner changes as follows:\n\n- When a **DRUKHARI** unit of yours destroys an enemy unit, your **DRUKHARI** units are winning.\n- When a **HARLEQUINS** unit of yours destroys an enemy unit, your **HARLEQUIN** units are winning.\n\nWhichever side is winning, the other is losing. When your **DRUKHARI** and **HARLEQUINS** models attack:\n\n- If the attacker's unit is winning, its **Hit rolls** of 1 may be re-rolled.\n- If the attacker's unit is losing, its Hit rolls of 1 and **Wound rolls** of 1 may be re-rolled.",
